LOCATION:Navarre Beach Sea Turtle Conservation Center\, 8740 Gulf Blvd\, Na
 varre Beach\, FL 32566
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/3 · 10:00 AM to 2:00 PM\n\nThe Navarre Beach Sea T
 urtle Conservation Center holds a Saturday morning event with crafts\, fac
 e painting\, photo opportunities and educational activities. Ambassador an
 imals come with the National Park Service\, Audubon Florida and the Emeral
 d Coast Science Center.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://c
 oastaleventures.com/events/ev-navarre-sea-turtle-extravaganza-1003.html
