SUMMARY:Grandparents Day at the Farm
LOCATION:Sweet Season Farms\, 2260 Horn Road\, Milton\, FL 32570
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/3 · 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM\n\nOne grandparent gets in 
 free with a paid grandchild admission for the day at the corn maze farm in
  Milton. Everything else about the day is the normal farm: the maze\, the 
 pumpkin patch and the rest of the attractions. Saturday hours are 9:00 AM 
 to 5:00 PM.\n\nPrice: from $18.50\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com
 /events/ev-sweet-season-grandparents-day-1003.html
