DTSTAMP:20261002T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261003T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261003T200000
SUMMARY:Night Hike with Nighttime Neighbors at the E.O. Wilson Biophilia Ce
 nter
LOCATION:E.O. Wilson Biophilia Center\, 4956 FL-20 E\, Freeport\, FL
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/3 · 4:00 PM to 8:00 PM\n\nThe E.O. Wilson Biophili
 a Center near Freeport opens its trails for an evening on the nocturnal si
 de of the forest. Families hike to the center's bat house for the evening 
 bat flight just after sunset\, learn about nocturnal wildlife\, and stop a
 t activity stations along the trail. Bring a flashlight.\n\nPrice: from $1
 0\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-biophilia-center-nigh
 t-hike-1003.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-biophilia-center-night-hike-1003
 .html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
