 tion site with snakes in the room\, run as a Halloween-season session. It 
 is $45 a person and the listing says all ages are welcome. It runs 5:30 PM
  to 7:00 PM up in Molino\, so budget close to an hour of driving each way.
 \n\nPrice: from $45\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-spo
 oky-snake-yoga-molino-1003.html
