 3
DESCRIPTION:Sat 10/10 10 AM-5 PM · Sun 10/11 10 AM-3 PM\n\nGulf Breeze Zoo
  turns its grounds into a Halloween trick-or-treat trail for the day\, wit
 h candy\, toys\, bounce houses\, face painting and the zoo's animal ambass
 adors out to meet visitors. The zoo opens at 10 AM for the event and does 
 not admit guests earlier\, and a Boo at the Zoo ticket includes regular zo
 o admission.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastalevent
 ures.com/events/ev-boo-at-the-zoo-2026-1010.html
