LOCATION:Sweet Season Farms\, 2260 Horn Road\, Milton\, FL 32570
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/10 · 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM\n\nScouts get a free patch
  with paid admission while supplies last\, and the corn maze is a real ori
 enteering problem rather than a walk. Group rates exist for parties of twe
 nty or more. Saturday hours are 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM.\n\nPrice: from $18.50\
