SUMMARY:Garnier Beach Garden Club
LOCATION:Fort Walton Beach Library\, 185 Miracle Strip Parkway SE\, Fort Wa
 lton Beach\, FL 32548
DESCRIPTION:10:30 AM to 1:00 PM\n\nLocal gardeners with the Garnier Beach G
 arden Club give in-depth talks and demonstrations on plants and gardening 
 at Fort Walton Beach Library\, for an adult audience. A second session is 
 scheduled for October 10\, so this is a recurring club meeting rather than
  a one time talk.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastal
 eventures.com/events/ev-garnier-beach-garden-club-0912.html
