DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261012T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261012T120000
SUMMARY:Homeschool and Small Group Day at Sweet Season Farms
LOCATION:Sweet Season Farms\, 2260 Horn Road\, Milton\, FL 32570
DESCRIPTION:Monday 10/12 · 9 AM to 12 PM\n\nThis is the only weekday Sweet
  Season Farms opens to homeschool groups\, small groups\, and families. Th
 e corn maze\, jumping pillow\, duck races\, and hay barn all stay open. Th
 e corn cannons stay off\, though\, and food options run thinner than a nor
 mal Saturday. Bring a lunch for the picnic tables and pay at the gate\; th
 ere is no advance sale.\n\nPrice: from $12.50\n\nDetails: https://coastale
 ventures.com/events/ev-sweetseasonfarms-homeschoolday-1012.html
