 ures.com
DTSTAMP:20261002T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261014T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261014T110000
SUMMARY:Todd Talk: Where Does Our Food Come From?
LOCATION:Magnolia Room\, Bellingrath Gardens & Home\, 12401 Bellingrath Gar
 dens Road\, Theodore\, AL 36582
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday 10/14 · 10:00 AM to 11:00 AM\n\nBellingrath's execut
 ive director\, Todd Lasseigne\, gives a one-hour talk in the Magnolia Room
  on where food actually comes from\, tracing the path from agriculture and
  plants to the people on the other end of it. The talk runs from 10 AM to 
 11 AM on Wednesday\, October 14. Members attend free\, and non-members pay
  $16.50.\n\nPrice: from $16.50\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/ev
 ents/ev-todd-talk-where-does-our-food-come-from-1014.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-todd-talk-where-does-our-food-co
 me-from-1014.html
