DESCRIPTION:Friday 10/23 & Friday 10/30 · 6 PM to 10 PM\n\nSweet Season Fa
 rms opens the corn maze after dark on two Fridays in October\; each visito
 r brings a flashlight. Admission also covers the hayride\, barnyard ball\,
  breed barn\, corn popper\, carousel\, and farm games\, though the corn ca
 nnons and cow train stay closed. Tickets run $18.50 per person at the gate
  plus tax\, with a lower rate for military with ID.\n\nPrice: from $16.50\
