SUMMARY:Civil War Trunk at Fort Pickens
LOCATION:Fort Pickens\, Gulf Islands National Seashore\, 1400 Fort Pickens 
 Rd.\, Pensacola Beach\, FL 32561
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays · 2:00 PM to 4:00 PM\n\nPark rangers open a hands-on
  Civil War trunk program at Fort Pickens every Thursday afternoon through 
 October 29. The program itself is free\, but the National Park Service's o
 wn fee page says the normal Gulf Islands National Seashore entrance fee or
  a qualifying park pass still applies to get into the park.\n\nPrice: Free
